  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.71 Perimeter-bonded sheet flooring installation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.71 “Perimeter-bonded sheet flooring installation” means the installation of sheet flooring with vinyl backing onto a non-porous substrate using an adhesive designed to be applied only to a strip of up to 4 inches wide around the perimeter of the sheet flooring.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
